## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- EMA9: `iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,9,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- EMA30: `iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,30,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- Momentum(10): `iMomentum(NULL,PERIOD_H1,10,PRICE_CLOSE,1)` — compare to 100.0
- Trendline break: `iHigh(NULL,PERIOD_H1,1) > iHigh(NULL,PERIOD_H1,2) && iHigh(NULL,PERIOD_H1,1) > iHigh(NULL,PERIOD_H1,3)`
- BUYSTOP: `iHigh(NULL,PERIOD_H1,1) + pip_offset`
- P3 sweeps: EMA fast/slow (5/9/13, 20/30/50), Momentum period (5/10/20), SL (30/40/60 pips)

